    {
      "id": "2.79.11",
      "label": "2.79.11",
      "numbers": [
        11
      ],
      "devanagari": "तत्र एव तम् नर व्याघ्रम् अभिषिच्य पुरः कृतम् |\nआनेष्यामि तु वै रामम् हव्य वाहम् इव अध्वरात्",
      "iast": "tatra eva tam nara vyāghram abhiṣicya puraḥ kṛtam |\nāneṣyāmi tu vai rāmam havya vāham iva adhvarāt",
      "translation": "\"Consecrating him, the tiger among men there itself, I shall surely bring Rama solemnized in front, as bringing home the sacred fire from a sacrificial rite, after performing it outside the city.\"",
